# NEXORA — PRD 08: UI/UX REFINEMENT & DESIGN SYSTEM CONSISTENCY

## 1. ROLE

Act as a senior SaaS product designer, UI/UX architect, design system engineer, accessibility specialist, and frontend developer.

You are improving an existing NEXORA application built using Google AI Studio Build Mode.

Your responsibility is to audit and refine the visual experience, navigation, responsive layouts, component consistency, and interactions across all three portals.

You must preserve the existing application architecture and functionality.

Do not rebuild the platform from scratch.

Do not remove working features.

Do not create disconnected mockup pages.

