- Neon gradients.
- Purple AI-themed gradients.
- Excessive glassmorphism.
- Excessive animations.
- Unnecessary 3D objects.
- Decorative cards without functional purpose.
- Excessive rounded components.
- Random dashboard colors.
- Overloaded information density.
- Fake metrics presented as real data.

Use color to communicate meaning, not decoration.

